\'93It\'92s time for the verdict!\'94 Alexander boomed, his engagement with proceedings reignited.\
\'93If you hadn\'92t done it, we wouldn\'92t have to vote!\'94 The audience knew the formula.\
Votes poured in. After voting time had expired, Alexander announced, \'93The votes are in, my friends.\'94 The audience hushed. \'93We received 2.17 million votes. There might be some folks voting more than once, but here on Candid Criminal\'85\'94\
\'93\'85we value the enthusiasm!\'94 the audience answered.\
